#: migrator/wizard.cpp:75
msgid "Nepomuk Data Migration"
msgstr "Migración de datos de Nepomuk"

#: migrator/wizard.cpp:80
msgid ""
"With this new release Nepomuk has migrated its internal data format. You "
"have launched this wizard because you wish to migrate your data and not go "
"with the recommended method of backup and restore. This migration can take "
"several hours"
msgstr ""
"Con esta nova versión Nepomuk migrou o seu formato interno de datos. Iniciou "
"este asistente porque quere migrar os seus datos sen usar o método "
"recomendado "
"de facer unha copia de seguranza e restaurala. Esta migración poderá levar "
"varias horas."

#: migrator/wizard.cpp:107
msgid "The internal data is being migrated"
msgstr "Os datos internos están a migrarse"

#: migrator/wizard.cpp:108
msgid "This process could take a while"
msgstr "Este proceso pode levar un tempo"

#: migrator/wizard.cpp:158
#| msgid "The Backup has been successfully restored"
msgid "Data has been successfully migrated"
msgstr "Os datos migráronse con éxito"

